{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39085","headline":"游九鲤湖 · 陈乘","name":"游九鲤湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汗漫乘春至，林峦雾雨生。\n洞莓黏屐重，岩雪溅衣轻。\n窟宅分三岛，烟霞接五城。\n却怜饶药物，欲辨不知名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈乘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39085.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39085","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}